Observation

Top Genre By Streams

Blues topped the chart as the most streamed  (1.008E+1) while punk streamed the least.

Top 5 Artist By Streams

Jay Zenith had the highest streams (1.105E+1) while the midnight Howl had the least streams (1.001E+11).

Top 5 Song By Release Year

2025 had the most streamed songs while 2019 had the least streamed songs.

Tiktok Virality By Artist

Jay Zenith had the highest tiktok virality while Luna Nova had the lowest tiktok virality.

Lyrics Sentiment By Genre

Techno drew the highest average lyrics sentiment while indie drew the lowest lyric sentiment.

Weekly Charts Longevity By Genre

Indie streamed the most on the weekly chart while latin streamed the least on the weekly chart.

Danceability VS Energy

Danceability increased at Energy level 4.03E+10 while it was at its lowest at energy level 3.43E+01.

Percentage Of Genre

Indie genre had the highest genre percentage (17.44%) while country had the lowest genre percentage (16.11%).

